  "releaseNotes": "Preserve unsaved documents when Save As is cancelled or saving fails before closing.\n      Save through a unique sibling temporary file, preserving the original and backup on write failure.\n      Commit document filename and modified state only after successful file replacement.\n      Honour window-close cancellation from the save prompt and retain WinForms click-handler signatures.\n      Expand regression coverage to 77 tests and fix filtered NUnit test execution.",
